Subject: [PATCH 1890/3799] soh: rename func_80B8FF8C -> ObjBean_Overshoot

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: stretches the plant past its final size on a sine and hands off to the settle once it passes the threshold.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c | 7 ++++---
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
index c1ff2eea7..8726e95d5 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Obj_Bean/z_obj_bean.c
@@ -47,7 +47,8 @@ void ObjBean_Sprout(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B8FEAC [LLM:
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B8FF50: installs the overshoot action at its starting angle.
 void ObjBean_SetupOvershoot(ObjBean* this);  // was func_80B8FF50 [LLM:HIGH]
 void ObjBean_SetupGrowWaterPhase4(ObjBean* this);
-void func_80B8FF8C(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play);
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was func_80B8FF8C: stretches the plant past its final size on a sine and hands off to the settle once it passes the threshold.
+void ObjBean_Overshoot(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play);  // was func_80B8FF8C [LLM:HIGH]
 void func_80B90050(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play);
 void func_80B90010(ObjBean* this);
 void func_80B908EC(ObjBean* this);
@@ -597,12 +598,12 @@ void ObjBean_Sprout(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play) {
 }
 
 void ObjBean_SetupOvershoot(ObjBean* this) {
-    this->actionFunc = func_80B8FF8C;
+    this->actionFunc = ObjBean_Overshoot;  // was func_80B8FF8C [LLM:HIGH]
     ObjBean_SetDrawMode(this, BEAN_STATE_DRAW_LEAVES | BEAN_STATE_DRAW_SOIL);
     this->unk_1B6.x = 0x33E9;
 }
 
-void func_80B8FF8C(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play) {
+void ObjBean_Overshoot(ObjBean* this, PlayState* play) {
     this->unk_1B6.x -= 0x960;
     this->dyna.actor.scale.y = Math_SinS(this->unk_1B6.x) * 0.17434467f;
     this->dyna.actor.scale.x = this->dyna.actor.scale.z = Math_CosS(this->unk_1B6.x) * 0.12207746f;
